OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPlenty of
OL,6,Fevening sunshine and then dry
OL,7,Fovernight with prolonged clear periods
OL,8,Fand variable cloud. Staying rather
OL,9,Fwarm in urban areas but considerably
OL,10,Fcooler in the countryside by dawn.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FAnother primarily sunny day
OL,13,Fwith just a little wispy high cloud at
OL,14,Ftimes. Slightly breezier than on
OL,15,FMonday but temperatures climbing
OL,16,Fhigher and becoming very warm by the
OL,17,Fafternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
